E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E9%9D%A2%E6%9D%BF%E5%8A%A0%E6%88%90%E3%80%82%E6%88%98%E5%9C%BA%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%A2%E8%A1%A8%E7%8E%B0%E8%89%AF%E5%A5%BD%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E8%AE%A9%E5%BD%BC%E5%B2%B8%E5%8F%8C%E7%94%9F%E6%89%BF%E6%8B%85%E4%B8%8D%E5%B0%91BOSS%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%AD%E9%AB%98%E5%88%86%E3%80%82%E6%B7%B1%E6%B8%8A%E6%96%B9%E9%9D%A2%E5%8F%97%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%92%8CBOSS%E7%89%B9%E6%80%A7%E4%BB%A5%E5%8F%8A%E7%8E%AF%E5%A2%83%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%EF%BC%8C%E5%9C%A8%E7%BA%A2%E8%8E%B2%E6%88%96%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%AE%B5%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8%E7%8E%B0%E5%B0%9A%E5%8F%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E5%AF%82%E7%81%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E5%8F%AA%E9%80%82%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%8E%E5%B0%8F%E6%80%AA%E5%B1%82%EF%BC%8CBOSS%E5%B1%82%E8%83%BD%E7%94%A8%E4%BD%86%E5%AF%B9%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E8%A6%81%E6%B1%82%E8%BE%83%E9%AB%98%EF%BC%88A%E5%B8%8C%E6%89%93%E9%87%8F%E5%AD%90%E5%B8%9D%E7%8E%8B%E9%99%90%E5%AE%9A%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1635605601484\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/27/72350798/e9edf305f93e0851a9a59b0985e510f6_2489092928999401454.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>彼岸双生</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">彼岸双生的专属超限武器，同时提供了暴击率物伤暴伤和标记的全伤加成，被动技能根据当前人格，加成也会有所不同</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/27/72350798/be9268960c2c3142b6bf74e33d872135_2664448112909566229.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>幻海梦蝶</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">同时提供了暴击率，暴击伤害与物理伤害加成，虽然无法吃满被动的加成，但是表现仍然优于童谣</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/72350798/bd06050f9fb738e8b41fcb6ecd27d143_2414829669061159652.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">彼岸双生的推荐超限武器，拥有较强物理通用性，但对元素角色只能提供面板加成。战场方面表现良好，能让彼岸双生承担不少BOSS的中高分。深渊方面受适用角色和BOSS特性以及环境影响，在红莲或以下段位表现尚可，但寂灭基本只适用于小怪层，BOSS层能用但对操作要求较高（A希打量子帝王限定）</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/09/72350798/bd06050f9fb738e8b41fcb6ecd27d143_2414829669061159652.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
